%% FSM di TaskController (src/body/modules/controllers/task_controller.py)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE

    IDLE --> NODE: am_i_in_a_node
    IDLE --> FOLLOWING: command==MOVE_TO & !in_node & next_node!=target_node
    IDLE --> REVERSE: command==MOVE_TO & !in_node & next_node==target_node
    IDLE --> IDLE: command==STOP / nessun comando

    NODE --> MANEUVERING: command==MOVE_TO
    NODE --> MANEUVERING: command in [PICKUP, DROP]
    NODE --> IDLE: command==STOP
    NODE --> NODE: nessun comando

    FOLLOWING --> NODE: am_i_in_a_node
    FOLLOWING --> IDLE: command==STOP
    FOLLOWING --> FOLLOWING: command==MOVE_TO & !in_node

    MANEUVERING --> IDLE: maneuver_state==COMPLETED & command in [PICKUP, DROP]
    MANEUVERING --> REVERSE: next_node==target_node & current_position!=target_node
    MANEUVERING --> IDLE: maneuver_state==COMPLETED
    MANEUVERING --> MANEUVERING: maneuver_state==NONE (avvia manovra)

    REVERSE --> GO_TARGET: maneuver_state==COMPLETED
    REVERSE --> REVERSE: maneuver_state==NONE (avvia svolta)

    GO_TARGET --> TARGET: am_i_in_a_node & target_node==current_position
    GO_TARGET --> IDLE: command==STOP
    GO_TARGET --> GO_TARGET: pid non attivo (avvia PID in retromarcia)

    TARGET --> MANEUVERING: command in [PICKUP, DROP]
    TARGET --> IDLE: qualsiasi altro caso

